# Renault 19 phase 2 five-door hatchback, 1992-1996.
#
# The phase-2 facelift of the Renault 19, announced in 1992 and built to 1996,
# when the Megane replaced the range. It is the same shell as the phase-1 car
# with a new front and rear treatment, and was built as a variant of the phase-1
# master rather than as a new model.
#
# Dimensions 4.156 x 1.694 x 1.412 m, wheelbase 2.540 m, unchanged from the
# phase-1 car. Source: the reference pack's notes, from the Renault 19
# dimension box.
#
# What differs from phase 1: a rounded front with larger headlamps, a wide
# grille set between them carrying the diamond, a smoother bonnet leading edge,
# a body-coloured bumper with a dark lower insert and round fog lamps, and at
# the rear smoked hatch trim with inward-extending red lamp bands and the plate
# moved to the bumper. The cabin, doors, roof, wheels and remaining flank are
# the phase-1 master's.
#
# Shape reference: a green phase-2 five-door front-left, a blue UK phase-2
# five-door front-right and the green car from the rear left. No true side
# elevation exists, so the model was compared at each photograph's angle and a
# true elevation was rendered for coherence.
#
# Colours: no British-market colour names were established, so the objects
# carry plain names: white, red, blue and grey. Weights white 3, red 3, blue 2,
# grey 2, total 10, provisional pending the central rebase.
#
# Speed 175 km/h and comfort 70/435, as the phase-1 car: the facelift changed
# trim and lamps, not the running gear. Classes 1,2.
#
# Dates are road presence: late 1992 intro, retires staggered 2005-2008 on a
# thirteen- to sixteen-year tail.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/renault-19-phase2.blend. Interchange:
# citycars/4.5/renault-19-phase2.dae (84 objects). References:
# citycars/references/renault-19-phase2/ (gitignored; Wikimedia Commons).
#
# Accepted deviations: the carried-over shell remains more angular than the
# photographs, the fog lamps and grille openings are simplified, and the
# comparison angles are approximate. At 128 px the rounded phase-2 nose with
# its grille between the lamps distinguishes it from the phase-1 car.

obj=citycar
name=Renault19Phase2(White)
copyright=JamesPetts

DistributionWeight=3
intro_year=1992
intro_month=10
retire_year=2008
retire_month=6
speed=175
length=3
class=1,2
maximum_comfortable_journey_minutes=70
maximum_tolerable_journey_minutes=435

Image[E]=./images/renault-19-phase2-white_E.0.0,-33,14
Image[SE]=./images/renault-19-phase2-white_SE.0.0,-13,0
